[1m[38;5;231mHow much should the reusable layer own beyond the validation rules themselves?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mCore + thin DOM binder (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mvalidate() plus bindForm() that collects values by name and renders error text. Live validation left out.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Pure validation core only
     [38;5;246mData in, errors out, no DOM. Smallest and most testable; form #2 still writes its own wiring. Binder can be added [39m
     [38;5;246mlater.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Core + binder + live validation
     [38;5;246mAlso validates on blur/input with error state per field. Best UX, most speculative surface.[39m
